        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Dining Etiquette</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #e0e0e0;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding: 20px;\n            font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"Kaiti SC\", \"STKaiti\", serif;\n            color: #222;\n            margin: 0;\n        }\n        .slide {\n            background-color: white;\n            width: 960px;\n            height: 540px;\n            margin-bottom: 20px;\n            box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);\n            padding: 30px 40px;\n            box-sizing: border-box;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .header {\n            border-bottom: 1px solid #a0a0a0;\n            padding-bottom: 10px;\n            margin-bottom: 30px;\n        }\n        .header h1 {\n            font-size: 20px;\n            margin: 0;\n            font-weight: bold;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n        }\n        .page-number {\n            position: absolute;\n            bottom: 20px;\n            right: 30px;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            color: #888;\n            font-family: sans-serif;\n        }\n\n        /* Slide 1 Layout */\n        .slide1-content {\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            height: 400px;\n        }\n        .diagram-container {\n            width: 450px;\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .clock-placeholder {\n            width: 110px;\n            height: 110px;\n            border-radius: 50%;\n            border: 4px solid #000;\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 90px;\n            left: 160px;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            font-size: 12px;\n            background-color: #fff;\n            color: #666;\n            box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px #fff, inset 0 0 0 3px #000;\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        .label {\n            position: absolute;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            text-align: center;\n            line-height: 1.3;\n            z-index: 2;\n        }\n        .label-top { top: 30px; left: 205px; }\n        .label-1 { top: 55px; left: 100px; }\n        .label-2 { top: 55px; left: 280px; }\n        .label-3 { top: 110px; left: 50px; }\n        .label-4 { top: 110px; left: 340px; }\n        .label-5 { top: 180px; left: 30px; }\n        .label-6 { top: 180px; left: 360px; }\n        \n        .dashed-box {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 215px;\n            left: 30px;\n            width: 380px;\n            height: 90px;\n            border: 2px dashed #a33;\n            border-radius: 10px;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .label-7 { top: 225px; left: 45px; }\n        .label-8 { top: 225px; left: 345px; }\n        .label-9 { top: 270px; left: 100px; }\n        .label-10 { top: 270px; left: 280px; }\n        \n        .serving-box {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 320px;\n            left: 185px;\n            border: 1px solid #333;\n            padding: 4px 12px;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            background: white;\n        }\n\n        .text-content-1 {\n            width: 420px;\n            padding-top: 20px;\n        }\n        .text-block {\n            margin-bottom: 50px;\n            line-height: 1.8;\n            font-size: 15px;\n        }\n        .text-block p {\n            margin: 6px 0;\n        }\n        .text-block .title {\n            margin-bottom: 12px;\n        }\n\n        /* Slide 2 Layout */\n        .slide2-content {\n            display: flex;\n            height: 420px;\n        }\n        .arrow-container {\n            width: 60px;\n            display: flex;\n            flex-direction: column;\n            align-items: center;\n            padding-top: 15px;\n        }\n        .arrow-shaft {\n            width: 12px;\n            height: 360px;\n            background-color: #95c793;\n        }\n        .arrow-head {\n            width: 0;\n            height: 0;\n            border-left: 18px solid transparent;\n            border-right: 18px solid transparent;\n            border-top: 22px solid #95c793;\n        }\n        .text-content-2 {\n            flex: 1;\n            padding-left: 10px;\n            font-size: 14px;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n        .text-content-2 p {\n            margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n        }\n        .text-content-2 .section-title {\n            font-weight: bold;\n            margin-top: 18px;\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n        }\n        .text-content-2 .section-title:first-child {\n            margin-top: 0;\n        }\n        .text-content-2 ul {\n            margin-top: 6px;\n            margin-bottom: 0;\n            padding-left: 20px;\n        }\n        .text-content-2 li {\n            margin-bottom: 6px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <!-- Slide 1 -->\n    <div class=\"slide\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <h1>座次礼仪</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"slide1-content\">\n            <div class=\"diagram-container\">\n                <div class=\"label label-top\">上位</div>\n                <div class=\"label label-1\">1号位<br>主宾</div>\n                <div class=\"label label-2\">2号位<br>第二主宾</div>\n                <div class=\"label label-3\">3号位</div>\n                <div class=\"label label-4\">4号位</div>\n                <div class=\"label label-5\">5号位</div>\n                <div class=\"label label-6\">6号位</div>\n                \n                <div class=\"clock-placeholder\">[Clock Diagram]</div>\n                \n                <div class=\"dashed-box\"></div>\n                <div class=\"label label-7\">7号位<br>主陪</div>\n                <div class=\"label label-8\">8号位<br>主陪</div>\n                <div class=\"label label-9\">9号位<br>副主陪</div>\n                <div class=\"label label-10\">10号位<br>副主陪</div>\n                \n                <div class=\"serving-box\">上菜位</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-content-1\">\n                <div class=\"text-block\">\n                    <div class=\"title\">最基本的原则</div>\n                    <p>1. 以右为上（遵循国际惯例）</p>\n                    <p>2. 以远为上（远离房门为上）</p>\n                    <p>3. 面门为上（良好视野为上）</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"text-block\">\n                    <p>如果面对门的12点钟是“上位”，</p>\n                    <p>领导在场：选择9号位或10号位</p>\n                    <p>领导不在场：选择7号位或8号位</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"page-number\">2</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Slide 2 -->\n    <div class=\"slide\">\n        <div class=\"header\">\n            <h1>点餐礼仪</h1>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"slide2-content\">\n            <div class=\"arrow-container\">\n                <div class=\"arrow-shaft\"></div>\n                <div class=\"arrow-head\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-content-2\">\n                <div class=\"section-title\">餐前了解3个问题：</div>\n                <p>这顿饭为何吃？这顿饭的预算？来宾的口味和禁忌？</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"section-title\">提前1小时到达：</div>\n                <p>放置指引牌等物料，最好拍摄餐厅入口发到群聊中作为导航指引</p>\n                <p>布置饭局场地，清点座椅数量，调好空调温度</p>\n                <p>找服务员要2份菜单，一份给老板或客户传阅，一份自己用于点单</p>\n                \n                <div class=\"section-title\">提前30分钟选餐：</div>\n                <p>假如到了n个客人，菜品分为前菜（凉菜）、热菜（硬菜、花荤、素菜）、主食</p>\n                <p>最合适共点（n+2）道菜，其中前菜（n/3）道、热菜（n/2）道，以双数为佳</p>\n                <p>假如今晚一共10个人吃饭，共点12道菜，其中3道前菜，热菜5道、1道汤、主食2道、甜品1道</p>\n                \n                <p style=\"margin-top: 18px;\">注：</p>\n                <ul>\n                    <li>荤素、冷热搭配：荤素6:4，冷热1:2为佳</li>\n                    <li>8道菜以上的宴请最好有一道完整的鱼菜</li>\n                    <li>尽量不要点龙虾、螃蟹等需要用手抓食、吃相不雅的菜品</li>\n                    <li>饭店有特色菜、或当地有出名特产菜可以点，增加和客人介绍的话题</li>\n                </ul>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"page-number\">3</div>\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
